[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
The sample %%PREFIX%%/etc/knockd.conf opens SSH by adding the knocking
address to the pf table <knockd> (5BSD runs OpenBSD PF; there is no ipfw).
Allow that table in /etc/pf.conf after the rules that block SSH:

  table <knockd> persist
  pass in proto tcp from <knockd> to port ssh
EOM
}
]
